{title: Chala Jaata Hoon}
{artist: Kishore Kumar Rd R D Burman}
{key: E}

{c: Verse 1}
[E]Chala jata hun, [A]kisi ki dhun mein
[B]dhadakte dil ke, [E]tarane liye
[A]milan ki masti, [E]bhari aankhon mein
[A]hazaro sapne [B]suhane liye [E]Chala jata hu
[E]ye masti ke, nazaren hain,
[B]to aise mein
[A]sambhalna [B]kaisa [E]meri qasam
[E]tu laharati Dagariya ho,
[B]to phir kyu na
[A]chalon [B]main bahaka [E]bahaka re
[A]mere jivan mein, [E]ye shaam ayi hai
[A]mohabat wale [B]zamane liye [E]Chala jata hu
[E]vo aalam bhi, ajab hoga,
[B]vo jab mere
[A]karib [B]aegi [E]meri qasam
[E]kabhi bayein chuda legi,
[B]kabhi hansake
[A]gale [B]se lag [E]jaegi hay
[A]meri bahon mein, [E]machal jaaegi
[A]vo sache [B]zute bahane liye [E]Chala jata hu
[E]baharon mein, nazaron mein,
[B]nazar Daalon
[A]to [B]aisa laage [E]meri qasam
[E]vo nainon mein, bhare kajal,
[B]ghungat khole
[A]khadi [B]hain mere [E]aage re
[A]sharam se bozl [E]zuki palko me
[A]jawan rato [B]ke fasane liye [E]Chala jata hu
